    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I love math because it's logical and creative, especially in problem-solving. As a student who enjoys literature and math, I find it a great balance between abstract thinking and real-world applications. It’s challenging but rewarding, and I often use it to improve my analytical skills through puzzles and proofs.",
